,"source":"news","author":"Business Standard","handle":"Business Standard","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-16T04:25:00.000Z","text":"Groww shares fall over 4% after block deal; most active stock on NSE","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-16T06:46:11.315Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-16T20:06:53.188Z"},{"id":"news-gn-QmNZTExXR2ZkdFVIWjRIeG0xdDBaWXU0","source":"news","author":"Moneycontrol.com","handle":"Moneycontrol.com","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-16T03:59:29.000Z","text":"Groww shares crash 4.5% after 1.69% equity sold in Rs 1,999-crore block deal; Peak XV, Sequoia likely...","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","sentiment":"bearish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-16T12:10:15.268Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-17T01:24:41.760Z"},{"id":"news-gn-R4SzdYTE5NbXNVYndaZzFpWWJKNVB4Zw","source":"news","author":"Moneycontrol.com","handle":"Moneycontrol.com","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-16T03:59:29.000Z","text":"Groww shares fall 2.5% after 1.69% equity sold in Rs 1,999-crore block deal; Peak XV, Sequoia likely sellers","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","sentiment":"bearish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-16T06:46:11.315Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-16T06:46:11.315Z"},{"id":"news-gn-1FS2FUSjY0aDM3U2F4SHRCUDhPbjFJQw","source":"news","author":"CNBC TV18","handle":"CNBC TV18","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-16T03:56:00.000Z","text":"Groww shares fall over 3% after block deal worth nearly ₹2,000 crore","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-16T06:46:11.315Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-17T01:24:41.760Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-651316","source":"valuepickr","author":"Prateek_Jha","handle":"@Prateek_Jha","community":"Groww - Billionbrains Garage Ventures","timestamp":"2026-09-11T17:07:08.012Z","text":"My 2 Cents on the Business Given the nature of a platform business, I think it’s difficult to make much sense of the valuation if we only look at what the business has today. I think the better way to look at it is what this business can potentially become. For a business like Groww, I would look at it over a 5–10 year horizon rather than getting too caught up in the current numbers. For example, look at MTF as a % of market cap - India is at ~0.29% vs. ~0.55% in Korea and ~2.0% in the US. So, at least on the MTF side, I think there is still a pretty long runway for growth. Similarly, for the…","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/groww-billionbrains-garage-ventures/223611/10","sentiment":"bullish","likes":2,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-19T11:33:32.544Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-19T11:33:32.544Z"},{"id":"news-gn-NqM1d2VmN4U29kdXBlZUdTV0E4RUlTcw","source":"news","author":"Business Standard","handle":"Business Standard","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-09-08T08:42:07.000Z","text":"Groww in sweet spot as Jefferies sees ample headroom in India's MTF book","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-08T17:19:15.307Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-09T06:19:20.034Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650939","source":"valuepickr","author":"Hemanpower","handle":"@Hemanpower","community":"Groww - Billionbrains Garage Ventures","timestamp":"2026-09-08T08:05:01.388Z","text":"BusinessLine – 8 Sep 26 Groww adds 2.23 lakh active clients in August, market share tops 29% Among the larger brokers, SBI Securities is the only one to report a decline, losing around 26,200 active clients and taking its base to 10.4 lakh Groww added roughly 2.23 lakh net active clients in August, taking the market share past 29% of NSE active clients for the first time. Steady upward trend through 2026 — Groww’s share moved from about 27.7% in January, to 28.3% by March, to 28.7-28.9% through June-July, and now past 29% in August.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/groww-billionbrains-garage-ventures/223611/9","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-09-19T11:33:32.544Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-19T11:33:32.544Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650079","source":"valuepickr","author":"Hemanpower","handle":"@Hemanpower","community":"Groww - Billionbrains Garage Ventures","timestamp":"2026-08-26T10:48:12.455Z","text":"In fact, Groww was recently added to the FTSE All-World Index and MSCI index. When a stock joins FTSE All-World or MSCI, every fund that tracks that index — ETFs, index mutual funds, pension funds mandated to mirror the benchmark — has to buy the stock, regardless of what they think. This puts the stock on the radar of large international institutional investors who often restrict themselves to index constituents, or who use the index as their starting universe for research.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/groww-billionbrains-garage-ventures/223611/8","sentiment":"bullish","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-18T11:12:27.806Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650077","source":"valuepickr","author":"Hemanpower","handle":"@Hemanpower","community":"Groww - Billionbrains Garage Ventures","timestamp":"2026-08-26T10:44:40.642Z","text":"Dear @sangi , This isn’t new , Groww has seen repeated block deals recently, including 7.78 crore shares worth nearly ₹1,500 crore in two trades just before this. This is typical post-IPO lock-in expiry pattern and not a signal of company weakness: Groww listed in Nov 2025, and early venture investors (Ribbit Capital, and previously Peak XV Partners/Sequoia in a separate May 2026 deal) are using block deals to gradually monetize their pre-IPO stakes now that lock-in restrictions have lifted.","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/groww-billionbrains-garage-ventures/223611/7","sentiment":"bearish","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-18T11:12:27.806Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650054","source":"valuepickr","author":"sangi","handle":"@sangi","community":"Groww - Billionbrains Garage Ventures","timestamp":"2026-08-26T08:14:41.337Z","text":"@Hemanpower What are your views on recent selling of early investors?","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/groww-billionbrains-garage-ventures/223611/6","sentiment":"bearish","likes":0,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-18T11:12:27.806Z"},{"id":"news-gn-ctaGdSOVVqcHhfR0QzaU5tZzJubWZhOA","source":"news","author":"Business Standard","handle":"Business Standard","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-08-26T06:45:11.000Z","text":"Groww falls nearly 4% after two block trades; most active stock on NSE","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z"},{"id":"valuepickr-650050","source":"valuepickr","author":"sangi","handle":"@sangi","community":"Groww - Billionbrains Garage Ventures","timestamp":"2026-08-26T06:34:32.644Z","text":"https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/markets/groww-stock-falls-3-as-2-1-equity-changes-hands-in-rs-2-500-crore-block-deal-ribbit-capital-likely-seller-14015616.html","url":"https://forum.valuepickr.com/t/groww-billionbrains-garage-ventures/223611/5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-09-18T11:12:27.806Z"},{"id":"news-gn-cmlwRzg1THVCbzYxTWVaNGJVV3ZjUENR","source":"news","author":"Dealroom","handle":"Dealroom","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-08-26T05:38:41.000Z","text":"₹2,500 crore Groww block deal knocks shares down 3%","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPbnBwdGNTUWpMOThNVnZDbFdRd3ZRZEhCeUZURE4xa0pmcDdqY1FCaGhWdTNXdEhQQ2RFS3U4dnlrcDVNWG9aOEZPdjdfZlM5a3llcnplZHZkMXI2VWJfLXhGZlFSd0VxS2Y0cnlSZ1lGRTZWcmlwRzg1THVCbzYxTWVaNGJVV3ZjUENR?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-08-26T14:10:08.537Z"},{"id":"news-gn